usage: resting_run.py [-h] --body-scene BODY_SCENE
                      --anatomy-receipt ANATOMY_RECEIPT --tendon TENDON
                      --lab LAB --build BUILD --output OUTPUT
                      [--seconds SECONDS] [--dimension {512,768,1024}]
                      [--mechanics-only] [--inspection-tour]
                      [--drive-intervention START END SCALE]

Launch the existing coupled Apple Metal Human scene from owner receipts. This
module loads and checks assets, records the invocation, and starts the native
process. It has no physical or physiological stepping implementation.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --body-scene BODY_SCENE
  --anatomy-receipt ANATOMY_RECEIPT
  --tendon TENDON
  --lab LAB
  --build BUILD
  --output OUTPUT
  --seconds SECONDS     physical duration; default permits 10 s initialization
                        plus 300 s observation
  --dimension {512,768,1024}
  --mechanics-only      diagnostic without the native viewer or movie
  --inspection-tour     cycle the native anatomical layers every five
                        simulated seconds without changing physics
  --drive-intervention START END SCALE
